  {
   "id": "f_priority",
   "ref": "U28",
   "label": "Word priority",
   "row": "features",
   "status": "planned",
   "kind": "code",
   "phase": "Phase 3",
   "description": "Code picks each lesson's target words from a shared word bank by need score: 0.4 domain (best over the learner's domains) + 0.3 situation + 0.2 who they talk to + 0.1 frequency, times S/A/B grade, (1 - mastery) and a level filter. Computed per lesson, never stored per user. Broad packs: general office, engineering common, hardware, software, AI/ML, network, electronics lab, quantum, sales, marketing, management, other (nearest by similarity). AI-drafted pack words are kept only if in the dictionary; confirmed by a second source or half weight; one start-up review, then learner signals.",
